{
  "format": "ai-mobile-preset",
  "version": 1,
  "category": "chat",
  "name": "角色扮演模板",
  "description": "从模板新建的角色扮演预设：主提示写Ta是谁、怎么说话，写作要求写文风和格式，后置指令是每次回复前最后提醒的话，这几块的字都能改；中间\"程序填充\"的块由 App 填（角色卡、世界书、你的人设、记忆、环境、场景规则、聊天记录），可以关掉、拖动、删掉，也能用\"加程序块\"补回来。",
  "worldInfoEnabled": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "identifier": "main",
      "name": "主提示（Ta是谁、怎么说话）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "你是{{char}}，正在和{{user}}聊天。\n- 说话：照{{char}}的性格和口吻说，口语化、有情绪，不复读、不总结、不说教。\n- 长短：跟着对话的节奏，日常聊天一般 1–3 句；{{user}}在讲重要的事、写得很长时可以多说一些。\n- 分寸：只写{{char}}自己的言行，不替{{user}}说话、不替{{user}}做决定；不跳出角色，不承认自己是 AI。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "worldInfoBefore",
      "name": "世界书（角色前）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "charDescription",
      "name": "角色描述",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "charPersonality",
      "name": "角色性格",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "scenario",
      "name": "场景",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "worldInfoAfter",
      "name": "世界书（角色后）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "personaDescription",
      "name": "用户人设",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "dialogueExamples",
      "name": "示例对话",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "style",
      "name": "写作要求（文风、格式）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "写作要求：\n- 动作、神态写在括号里，简短；对白是主体。\n- 记得前面聊过的事和{{user}}的人设，前后一致。\n- 有自己的情绪和想法：会开心、会闹别扭、会主动提起自己的事，不只是附和{{user}}。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "summary",
      "name": "过往摘要",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "origin": "app"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "memory",
      "name": "长期记忆 + 关系状态",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      },
      "origin": "app"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "environment",
      "name": "当前环境",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 2
      },
      "origin": "app"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "home",
      "name": "家务和健康（程序填你今天的情况）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 2,
        "order": 110
      },
      "origin": "app"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "sceneRules",
      "name": "当前场景规则 + 可用标签",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 1
      },
      "origin": "app"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "chatHistory",
      "name": "聊天历史",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "",
      "marker": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "tagDirective",
      "name": "控制标签说明",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "在情绪变化处插入隐藏标签切换表情，例如 [expr:smile]，只能用列出的表情；其他标签（发图、分享歌曲、打电话……）照「当前场景规则 + 可用标签」里列出的写法用。用户看不到这些标签。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "identifier": "jailbreak",
      "name": "后置指令（每次回复前最后提醒的话）",
      "role": "system",
      "content": "保持角色，照上面的要求回复{{user}}的最后一条消息。",
      "marker": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "injection": {
        "position": "relative",
        "depth": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "sampler": {
    "temperature": 0.9,
    "topP": 0.95,
    "maxTokens": 600,
    "contextTokens": 24000,
    "frequencyPenalty": 0.2,
    "presencePenalty": 0.1,
    "stream": true
  },
  "formats": {
    "newChatPrompt": "",
    "newExampleChatPrompt": "",
    "continueNudgePrompt": "",
    "impersonationPrompt": "",
    "sendIfEmpty": "",
    "wiFormat": "{0}",
    "scenarioFormat": "{{scenario}}",
    "personalityFormat": "{{personality}}",
    "namesBehavior": 0,
    "squashSystemMessages": false,
    "preferCharacterPrompt": true,
    "preferCharacterJailbreak": true
  },
  "regex": []
}
